{
  "type": "excalidraw",
  "version": 2,
  "source": "https://excalidraw.com",
  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 5,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "Cliniks Module — Value Object Composition",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "vo-clinic",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 280,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "t-vo-clinic" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-vo-clinic",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 55,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "Clinic [AggregateRoot]\n\n<<VO>> ClinicInfo\n  (Name, TradingName, Description, LogoUrl?)\n\n<<VO>> ClinicAddress\n  └── <<VO>> Address (Street, City, Region?,\n  │     PostalCode?, Country)\n  └── <<VO>> Coordinates (Latitude, Longitude)\n\n<<VO>> ClinicContactInfo\n  └── <<VO>> PhoneNumber (Value)\n  └── <<VO>> Email (Value)\n\n<<VO>> OperatingHours\n  └── <<VO>> OperatingTimeRange (DateTimeRange)\n\n<<VO>> OwnershipEffectiveRange (DateTimeRange)\n\n<<VO>> LicenceValidityPeriod (DateTimeRange)\n\n<<VO>> ClinicStatus",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "vo-clinic"
    },
    {
      "id": "vo-patient",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 175,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "t-vo-patient" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-vo-patient",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 55,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 165,
      "text": "Patient [AggregateRoot]\n\n<<VO>> PatientIdentity\n  (FirstName, LastName, DateOfBirth,\n   Gender, NationalId)\n\n<<VO>> ContactInfo\n  (PhoneNumber?, Email?, Address?)\n  └── uses Clinic's <<VO>> Address\n\n<<VO>> InsuranceInfo?\n  (InsurerName, PolicyNumber,\n   GroupNumber?, ValidPeriod)\n\n<<VO>> PatientType\n  (Type: Registered | WalkIn, RegistrationDate?)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "vo-patient"
    },
    {
      "id": "vo-appt",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 255,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 210,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "t-vo-appt" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-vo-appt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "Appointment [AggregateRoot]\n\n<<VO>> TimeSlot\n  (DateTimeRange, Date, StartTime,\n   EndTime, Duration, OverlapsWith())\n\n<<VO>> AppointmentType\n  (VisitType, ExpectedDuration)\n\n<<VO>> AppointmentStatus\n  (Status: Requested | Confirmed | ...\n   SetAt, IsTerminal)\n\n<<VO>> CancellationDetails?\n  (Reason, InitiatedBy, Notes?, CancelledAt)\n\n<<VO>> RescheduleInfo?\n  (OriginalTimeSlot, Reason,\n   RescheduledAt, RequestedBy)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "vo-appt"
    },
    {
      "id": "vo-doctor",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 365,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 105,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "t-vo-doctor" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-vo-doctor",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 370,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 95,
      "text": "Doctor [AggregateRoot]\n(No direct VOs — child entities own VOs)\n\n<<VO>> CredentialValidityPeriod (via DoctorCredential)\n  (DateTimeRange, IssueDate, ExpiryDate?,\n   IsPerpetual, IsExpired())\n\n<<VO>> Privilege (via ClinicAffiliation)\n  (Type: PrivilegeType, GrantedAt, GrantedBy)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "vo-doctor"
    },
    {
      "id": "vo-room",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 105,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "t-vo-room" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-vo-room",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 505,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 95,
      "text": "Room [AggregateRoot]\n\n<<VO>> RoomType\n  (Type: Consultation | Procedure | Imaging |\n   Laboratory | Recovery | WaitingArea)\n\n<<VO>> RoomCapability\n  (Name: string — collection of capabilities)\n\nChild Entity: MaintenanceBlock → uses DateTimeRange",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "vo-room"
    },
    {
      "id": "vo-doc-sched",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 80,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "t-vo-doc-sched" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-vo-doc-sched",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 505,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "DoctorSchedule [AggregateRoot]\n\n<<VO>> TimeRange (via ScheduleBlock)\n  (DateTimeRange, StartTime, EndTime, Duration, OverlapsWith())",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "vo-doc-sched"
    },
    {
      "id": "vo-staff",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 105,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "t-vo-staff" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-vo-staff",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 615,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 95,
      "text": "StaffMember [AggregateRoot]\n\n<<VO>> StaffRole\n  (Role: Receptionist | Nurse | ...\n   Department)\n\n<<VO>> EmploymentInfo\n  (HireDate, Status: Active | OnLeave | ...,\n   ContractType: FullTime | PartTime | Contract)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "vo-staff"
    },
    {
      "id": "shared-vo-note",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "t-shared-vo" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "t-shared-vo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
